{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起从前亲近的日子，心里重新热起来，也有了劲头，想把往后的日子过好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、振作，夹着一点担心\",\n      \"missed\": \"第三块里害怕还要等很久才能遇到亲近的人的不安，以及第四块即使没有人愿意亲近自己，也要好好生活、不再为了留人咽下委屈的完整态度。上方音乐说明和心跳被推到最高处的小字也不容易抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他被过去亲近的回忆重新鼓起劲，想不再跟过去较劲，把以后的日子过好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、冲劲、振奋，隐约焦虑\",\n      \"missed\": \"第三块从担心等待太久到逐渐平静的转折，以及第四块对未来可能没有亲近之人的心理准备。新增的快速八度说明和心跳描述都是小字，需要专门看才能读到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他从想起过去的温暖、重新振作，到慢慢平静下来，开始接受未来可能有人也可能没有，并决定好好珍惜自己。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、冲动、不安、平静、释然、坚定\",\n      \"missed\": \"第三块装饰音带来的不安和回落后的喘息感，以及第四块低音退去、最后高音和弦的具体画面，还有最后一个和弦究竟代表作出决定还是从梦中醒来的双重解释。这些都需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"四块主文字都比较长，而且字号、加粗程度和视觉权重相近，第一眼需要在多块内容之间来回选择。虽然彩色强调词已经能串出回忆带来温暖、重新振作、担心等待、逐渐平静、学会珍惜自己的情绪变化，整体故事其实很连贯，但要一次抓住完整变化仍有难度。第三张新增的音乐解释小字进一步增加了扫读负担，不过没有破坏主叙事的关联。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f57dd23d-c7d7-4d2d-9380-596762ef454f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001802498564Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:19:30.388913+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bceb91d0c0c71aab2470ec7b3143d69f05098d1ed31b237d0d13025965d8eb18", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T001802498564Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9a7218eab433c7eb31f6714ba5194e6157a9b62082316e88eb9d8f0a881a917b"}}}
